---
description: >-
  A note on a boundary member with another member between it and the actor
  outside: the extending use case sits in the rank before its target, so the
  note goes on the target's far side, beside it, not next to the actor.
---
usecase-beta
  systemBoundary Shop
    Checkout("Check out")
    Coupon("Apply coupon")
  end
  actor Customer
  Customer --> Checkout
  Coupon ..> : extend Checkout
  note for Checkout "Needs a basket"
